  "reflectionText": "Joshua set a great stone under the oak in Yahweh's sanctuary, and the stone stood for what had been said in the hearing of all Israel. What is it to speak a choice aloud before all the people, with a stone set under the oak as the thing that will remember it for you longer than you can on your own?"
